aphaser triangular-modulated phaser (src/audio/aphaser.ts)

src/audio/aphaser.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_aphaser.c: the in_gain,
out_gain, delay, decay, speed and type options with their defaults and ranges,
init()'s "out_gain may cause clipping" condition, config_output()'s
delay_buffer_length ((int)(delay * 0.001 * sample_rate + 0.5)) with its
"delay is too small" refusal and modulation_buffer_length
((int)(sample_rate / speed + 0.5)), the PHASER and PHASER_PLANAR kernels (MOD
ring indexing, double accumulation, C conversion to the sample type) and the
FILTER_SAMPLEFMTS list (dbl, dblp, flt, fltp, s32, s32p, s16, s16p). It also
adapts the WAVE_TRI branch of libavfilter/generate_wave_table.c
(ff_generate_wave_table for AV_SAMPLE_FMT_S32 with min 1, max
delay_buffer_length and phase M_PI / 2.0: phase offset, triangle, scaling,
+-0.5 rounding and int32 truncation).

